## Decisions already made — please don't reverse these without asking

- Re-pooling leads **grants** extra attempts, never resets `attempts_count`.
- Nothing bypasses `scrub()` — no bulk action, no callback, no manual dial, no phone feature.
- Whoever owns a call is the only one who can edit it; everyone else, including admins, is view-only.
- Nobody verifies and closes the same customer, except by an audit-logged admin override.
- Admins have everything; restrictions apply only to verifiers and licensed agents, and I control them from the Permissions grid.
- Rates are never computed from samples too small to mean anything; users are compared against the team median, never ranked.
- The app never shows a balance it cannot verify; an estimate is labelled as one.
- Depth over coverage on compliance work — a thin version is worse than none.
- Every prompt must end with an instruction to test and verify in the real browser and reconcile on-screen numbers against the database.
- Claude Code cannot reach the laptop, my phone, or the Twilio and Retell dashboards. Anything there is MANUAL TEST REQUIRED, never claimed as passing.

